WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,630 --> 00:00:04,630
Liupin leaves

2
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:26,090
What the old man didn’t bring back that year turned out to be his fire table

3
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:30,100
Go to Daqing and go home

4
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:40,300
What time is it?

5
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:42,060
I'll have to find someone to go into the mountains soon.

6
00:00:43,650 --> 00:00:45,170
The old bear collar is not our backyard

7
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:46,450
How can I say I will come back?

8
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:51,840
I couldn't find the meat, so I picked up something else.
